<section class="lp-sec" id="features">
        <h2 class="lp-h2">Everything you test on, nothing to pay</h2>
        <div class="fgrid">
          <div class="feat"><span class="fi"><svg class="ic i16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"/></svg></span><h4 aria-level="3">One-click root</h4><p>None, Shell root or Full root with Magisk. Jidr patches, reboots and verifies, then shows the badge.</p></div>
          <div class="feat"><span class="fi"><svg class="ic i16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></span><h4 aria-level="3">GPS and route replay</h4><p>Set a point on the map or replay a GPX/KML route at 1×, 2× or 4×.</p></div>
          <div class="feat"><span class="fi"><svg class="ic i16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="10" x="2" y="7" rx="2"/><path d="M22 11v2M6 11v2M10 11v2"/></svg></span><h4 aria-level="3">Sensors</h4><p>Battery, rotation, network speed and delay, fingerprint, clipboard, microphone.</p></div>
          <div class="feat"><span class="fi"><svg class="ic i16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5M12 7v5l4 2"/></svg></span><h4 aria-level="3">Snapshots</h4><p>Save and restore states. Each snapshot remembers the root mode it was taken in.</p></div>
          <div class="feat"><span class="fi"><svg class="ic i16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2M20 14h2M15 13v2M9 13v2"/></svg></span><h4 aria-level="3">Agent-native</h4><p>Every button is a CLI command and an MCP tool: screenshot, tap, type, read logs.</p></div>
          <div class="feat"><span class="fi"><svg class="ic i16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 17 6-6-6-6M12 19h8"/></svg></span><h4 aria-level="3">CLI with JSON</h4><p>Create, boot, test and destroy headless in CI. Every command has --json.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
